Crafting stations and the Dismantle Bench drop their output one item at a time, so a big batch of anything leaves a pile of single items: craft 100 items, and you press the pickup key 100 times. With this mod, you pick up one of them by hand, and the items of the same type that lie near it go into your inventory too.

[size=4][b]Main features[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Pile pickup[/b]: pick up one item by hand, and every item of the same type within 2 m comes with it, on the ground, a shelf, or a workbench. Works for crafting and Dismantle Bench output, items you dropped, and loot.[/*]
[*][b]Arrows[/b]: pick up one arrow, and the other arrows of the same type within 2 m come with it, on the ground or stuck in a body.[/*]
[*][b]Same rules[/b]: your inventory limits apply as usual. When it fills up, the rest of the pile stays where it lies. A bag with items in it never comes with the pile, so its contents are safe.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Save safety[/b][/size]
The mod stores nothing in your save, so you can remove it at any time.

[size=4][b]Multiplayer[/b][/size]
Tested only in single player. In co-op, only the host needs the mod: the pile pickup then works for every player. A player who joins a host without the mod gets the normal pickup, with or without the mod.

[size=4][b]Works well with[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/permafrost/mods/5]Custom Stack Size[/url]: bigger stacks, so more of each pile fits in your inventory.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Permafrost (Early Access), the update of 30 October 2026 or later.[/*]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/permafrost/mods/42]UE4SS for Permafrost[/url], the UE4SS build that the mod is tested with.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/permafrost/mods/42]UE4SS for Permafrost[/url].[/*]
[*]Extract this mod's zip into the game folder (the folder with Permafrost.exe). The mod lands in Permafrost\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods. Full path example:
[code]C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\Permafrost\Permafrost\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods\ProximityPickup[/code][/*][/list]

[size=4][b]Uninstall[/b][/size]
Delete the [font=Courier New]ProximityPickup[/font] folder from the [font=Courier New]ue4ss\Mods[/font] folder.

[size=4][b]Configuration[/b][/size]
To change mod settings, edit [font=Courier New]ue4ss\Mods\ProximityPickup\config.lua[/font] while the game is closed (see [url=https://github.com/ivmakk-pf/pf-proximity-pickup/blob/main/CONFIG.md]CONFIG.md[/url] for every setting). Changes apply at the next game start.

